- description: Structural extraction that builds the Actions Bill of Materials graph

# Everything here yields BQRS and no SARIF, so this suite is run through `codeql query run`
# rather than `database analyze`. Each query declares how its results are to be read — an
# `abom-edges` or `abom-observation` tag, or a `@kind` — and is ingested on that basis alone, so
# adding a query to this file is all it takes to have it run and stored.
#
# Security findings deliberately live in abom-findings.qls instead. They are a different lane
# with a different cost, and which tier pays that cost is configuration rather than a property
# of the query set.

- query: AbomEdges.ql
- query: AbomSurface.ql
- query: AbomStepConditions.ql
